      "writtenOn": "2018-01-22T14:16:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why this complexity? Seems we\u0027d be better off with a) sequential allocation like ConnectivityService#reserveNetId or b) random allocation backed by a set-like structure like HashMap/Set/SparseIntArray? Those would be much easier to read/understand/debug, and I can\u0027t imagine insertion performance would be an issue given that this is @SystemApi and each privileged app can only create at most 2 tunnels out of a range 1024  tunnels long.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 711,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 711,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "40b4bf1534b39f3811b88fa23b68db66e445077a",
