        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-22T18:28:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Considering netIds are system wide, and this range of netid are (if I understand correctly) exclusively handled by IpSecService, I wanted to make sure it was reserved properly, and kept as safe as possible. This seemed like a clear and performant way to do it.\n\nAlso, since this allocates the first keys available, I felt that it would actually be easier to debug than having random keys being allocated.",
