      "writtenOn": "2018-01-22T19:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After discussion with nharold, it seems like IP addresses are inherently racy, and there is no real way to test IP addresses. It appears that there is no failure notification. \n\nThis is also tracked in bug b/72316676.",
      "parentUuid": "58009faa_6ab66543",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1197,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1197,
        "endChar": 36
      },
